        "compress one-hot (or sparse) requests to a binary code",
        "add carry bits",
        "only generate clocks"
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "explain": "Encoder compresses toward a binary code (+ valid).",
      "difficulty": "medium"
    },
    {
      "id": "mux_medium_04",
      "type": "true_false",
      "prompt": "A decoder should assert every Y line on each address.",
